	(text "RC time constant = 10 us (10k x 1nF); NOT a guaranteed dead time. Schmitt threshold and tolerances set ON delay.\nFast diode discharge assists turn-off. Measure old-driver Hi-Z BEFORE new-driver enable across power/ARM transitions.\nVerify power ramps, brownouts, rapid detection toggles and re-powering; steady-state truth tables do not prove transients."
  (exclude_from_sim no)
  (at 15 264 0)
